#. type: Title =
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:1
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "FreeBSD Accessibility Handbook"
msgstr "Manual de Accesibilidad de FreeBSD"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:51
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "Resumen"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Accessibility Handbook.  This book covers the assistive "
"technologies available in FreeBSD."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido al Manual de Accesibilidad. Este libro cubre las tecnologías de "
"asistencia disponibles en FreeBSD."

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Accessibility is an ongoing effort, not a fixed destination.  As such, this "
"handbook is a living document and continually evolving.  Contributions, "
"suggestions, and feedback are highly encouraged.  If you are interested in "
"contributing, please reach out to us via the https://lists.freebsd.org/"
"subscription/freebsd-accessibility[FreeBSD accessibility mailing list]."
msgstr ""
"La accesibilidad es un esfuerzo constante, no un destino fijo. Como tal, "
"este manual es un documento vivo en constante evolución. Contribuciones, "
"sugerencias y feedback son bienvenidos. Si estas interesado en contribuir, "
"por favor contactanos a través de https://lists.freebsd.org/subscription/"
"freebsd-accessibility[la lista de mails de accesibilidad de FreeBSD]."

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/_index.adoc:61
msgid ""
"You can download this book in various formats and compression options from "
"the FreeBSD download server or one of its many mirror sites."
msgstr ""
"Puedes descargar este libro en varios formatos y opciones de compresión "
"desde el servidor de descarga de FreeBSD or desde uno de nuestras numerosas "
"réplicas."

